title: "DPP Schema: Open JSON-LD vocabulary for the EU Digital Product Passport"
abstract: "An open, CC0-licensed JSON-LD schema for Digital Product Passport data on the web. Production-tested vocabulary covering ESPR-mandated fields not yet in Schema.org or GS1. Designed as a CIRPASS-aligned bridge until CEN/CENELEC EN 18000 publishes."
